    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>因为蛋仔目前工作和夜场经济相关，</span></p><p><span>所以我们来聊一下目前国内以及国外的夜（店）文化的兴衰沉浮。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">00:02:42</a> 夜店消失浪潮，PartyK逐渐涌现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">00:09:00</a> 行业上行，出现的商业机会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">00:15:03</a> Party K到底满足了什么需求？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">00:22:33</a> 夜生活的分化，是年轻人娱乐需求的多元</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">00:33:00</a> 中式娱乐输出到东京</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2488">00:41:28</a> 东南亚娱乐场所的形式变化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">00:47:15</a> 娱乐方式的选择是圈层分化的缩影吗</span></p><p><span>BGM：KAYTRANADA - Snap My Finger ft. PinkPantheress</span></p><p><span>【聊天的人】</span></p><p><span>🌮西格莱</span></p><p><span>自由行超过 25 国，旅居日本，热爱吃喝玩乐</span></p><p><span>永远年轻，永远怕看牙医</span></p><p><span>🍶蛋仔</span></p><p><span>什么都略懂，有着众多的好哥哥</span></p>]]></description>
