    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>无意中一次闲聊，我发现我高中时听过的歌，蛋仔也在听，于是我们想做一期关于各自高中时代的歌的节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们各自准备歌单，却发现有些部分是重合的</span></p><span></span><p><span>在那个万物欣欣向荣的年代，文化产业也蓬勃发展</span></p><span></span><p><span>好的音乐，不管什么时候听，都让人开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a>宁夏 梁静茹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a>Love Story Taylor Swift</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">11:56</a> 止战之殇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a> 一路向北</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> Holiday by GreenDay</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1409">23:29</a> Something in the way</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1562">26:02</a> 月牙湾 飞儿乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a> Hey Boy 王诗安</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a> 樱桃 大冢爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> Plastic Love 竹内玛利亚</span></p><span></span><p><span>【聊天的人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌮西格莱</span></p><span></span><p><span>自由行超过 25 国，旅居日本，热爱吃喝玩乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>永远年轻，永远怕看牙医</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍶蛋仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>什么都略懂，有着众多的好哥哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>腰旗橄榄俱乐部主理人</span></p>]]></description>
