  <item>
    <title>EP. 25 “我家开火葬场的”——殡葬行业那些事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e4323ada891a9cd9c4f636</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e4323ada891a9cd9c4f636</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Mar 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>殡葬行业，神秘又不神秘的行业。今天我们来聊一聊殡葬行业那点事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：西格莱</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：嘻嘻</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小珏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> 从《入殓师》到《三悦有了新工作》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 白班 800 夜班 1600？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 有编制的体制内工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> 实际工资有多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">03:59</a> “灰色收入”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">04:58</a> 文职和技术工种的工作内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">05:56</a> 文职和技术工中的收入差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a> 招聘标准是什么？有专业要求么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a> 有所谓的“夜班入职测试”么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 入职会做心理测试么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> 行业内会在意社会上的一些“玩梗”么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a> 会去看员工八字么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a> 员工自己会带法器之类的么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> 职业晋升空间的天花板是殡仪馆馆长么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a> 关于“工伤”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1409">23:29</a> 职业使命感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a> 员工婚姻问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> 发生过的恐怖故事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> 有没有印象深刻的事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 发生过什么尴尬的事么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2154">35:54</a> 员工流动率</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客《希望顺利播出》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpvF-EzasGpihnh9_yTPZEF-JDSo.m4a" length="40341218" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZoOGJJaks3cUc3S0JsR0IzVXdzLXlSLV9zM2kucG5n.png"/>
